        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 4:55AM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...SE wind 35 kt. Seas 13 ft. Widespread rain showers.
.TONIGHT...SE wind 20 kt. Seas 12 ft.
.SAT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 10 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 9 ft.
.SUN...SW wind 15 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.MON THROUGH TUE...W wind 25 kt. Seas 9 ft.
</description>
